{
  "ledger": [
    "Main woman (dark navy cardigan, light gray skirt/shorts, ponytail, silver watch on left wrist) | walking toward camera holding red apple with both hands at chest, blue umbrella centered above head, feet alternating ground contact | in right profile / 3/4 rear view still holding apple with both hands and umbrella shaft between palms, smiling, mid-stride | continuous forward walk then slight left turn as camera orbits from front to side to rear, hands maintain grip throughout",
    "Blue umbrella (open canopy, thin silver shaft/black handle) | open above woman's head, shaft vertical between both palms | still open above head, shaft vertical gripped between palms | remains centered over woman with no release, moves with her translation and rotation",
    "Red apple | held bimanually at chest height, fingers wrapped around surface | held bimanually at chest height in same grip | maintained in both hands without hand-off or drop, slight rotation with hands",
    "Ground / market aisle (wet paved surface) | provides support under woman's feet and background pedestrians | same support surface | continuous foot-ground contacts for walking",
    "Background pedestrians and market stalls (produce crates both sides, red/blue awnings) | multiple people walking in aisle, stalls static with produce | same stalls, pedestrians have passed through frame | foreground crossers (woman in light blue shirt 00:01, man in white shirt 00:03) occlude briefly then exit, distant group approaches continuously"
  ],
